```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:ClearDay ;
    ex:hasTimeOfDay ex:Daytime .

ex:ClearDay a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:visibilityDistance "High" ;
    ex:lightingCondition "Bright" .

ex:Daytime a ex:TimeOfDay ;
    ex:time "12:00"^^xsd:time .

ex:Road ex:hasLaneMarkings ex:DoubleYellowSolidWhite ;
    ex:hasTrafficSigns ex:NoneVisible ;
    ex:hasSpeedLimit "30"^^xsd:integer .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType "AutonomousCar" ;
    ex:vehicleColor "Red" ;
    ex:position "Front" ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle2 .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType "Car" ;
    ex:vehicleColor "Green" ;
    ex:position "MiddleRight" ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle3 .

ex:Vehicle3 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType "Car" ;
    ex:vehicleColor "Gray" ;
    ex:position "MiddleLeft" .

ex:Building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:position "LeftSide" ;
    ex:buildingType "Residential" .

ex:Building2 a ex:Building ;
    ex:position "RightSide" ;
    ex:buildingType "ApartmentComplex" .

ex:TrafficLight1 a ex:TrafficLight ;
    ex:position "MiddleDistance" ;
    ex:status "Green" .

ex:PedestrianCrossing1 a ex:PedestrianCrossing ;
    ex:position "MiddleDistance" ;
    ex:hasCrosswalkMarkings true .

ex:Obstacle1 a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:obstacleType "ConstructionBarrier" ;
    ex:position "RightSide" .
```

---

```plaintext
Identified Risks for each risk class
```

**Risk 1:**
Description:
The autonomous vehicle (ex:Vehicle1) is closely following another vehicle (ex:Vehicle2) in a lane that appears to be merging or transitioning into a different road layout. The lack of visible traffic signs and potential for lane changes or unexpected vehicle behavior from ex:Vehicle2 could lead to a collision.

Severity Score: 0.7

---

**Risk 2:**
Description:
The presence of a construction barrier (ex:Obstacle1) on the right side of the road could obscure the view of pedestrians or cyclists attempting to cross or enter the road. This could lead to an undetected crossing event.

Severity Score: 0.6

---

**Risk 3:**
Description:
The green traffic light (ex:TrafficLight1) indicates that vehicles have the right of way, but the absence of visible pedestrians does not rule out the possibility of pedestrians crossing at the crossing (ex:PedestrianCrossing1) without being immediately visible.

Severity Score: 0.5

---

**Risk 4:**
Description:
The road infrastructure (ex:Road) has double yellow and white lane markings, which might confuse drivers unfamiliar with the road layout, potentially leading to incorrect lane usage or merging.

Severity Score: 0.4

---
The severity scores are based on the likelihood and potential impact of each risk, with 1 being the highest severity. The scores are subjective and based on the visual information provided.